  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) Access as a Tool for Peacebuilding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve access to clean water, sanitation, and hygiene services in Bungha, Pushit, Sabon Gari, and Kasuwan Ali communities, Mangu LGA, Plateau State. It will strengthen social cohesion by establishing inclusive Water Management Committees, constructing water points, and promoting hygiene practices alongside peacebuilding dialogues, fostering cooperation among diverse groups and contributing to sustainable peace.</narrative>
  </description>
